msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Starting at Level 1, you'll fight a string of\r\n"
"enemies leading up to a showdown with the final\r\n"
"boss, Mine. Defeat him to clear the mission.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You'll be given one randomly-selected weapon and\r\n"
"one recovery item. Check the \"Items\" section of\r\n"
"the Pause menu to see what you've been given."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"You'll face a variety of enemies, ranging from\r\n"
"weak to strong.\r\n"
"You may suddenly find yourself facing a very\r\n"
"powerful enemy, so always be prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"In addition to Mine, eight other boss characters\r\n"
"can be found throughout the city. A battle will\r\n"
"start automatically if you approach one of them.\r\n"
"Avoid the bosses if you think your level isn't\r\n"
"high enough to face them yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"You can retire the mission after beating any\r\n"
"of the boss characters other than Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"When you clear the mission, you'll be given a\r\n"
"reward based on the amount of money and experience you have.\r\n"
"If you get a Game Over before clearing the\r\n"
"mission, your reward will be reduced. Retiring\r\n"
"after a boss battle will not reduce your reward.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"The mission will now begin. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1772"
msgid "Defeat Mine!"
msgstr ""